              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Duchess, also known as Glenwood, is a one-deck reserved-packer patience in the Demon family."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Duchess, also known as Glenwood, is a traditional one-deck patience in the Demon family. It uses the classic combination of tableau, reserve, stock, waste, and foundations, with reserve management providing most of the strategic pressure."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Setup",
          "subtitle": "Table, deck, equipment, and deal",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "1 players use the table arrangement described for Duchess."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "52-card standard pack"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "52-card standard pack, score area, and enough table space for play."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Deal the reserve and tableau from one deck, then start foundations from the permitted base rank."
            }
